{"title":"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5af07cc12dc44656ba623a0b2f8e02397bc63bb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HF = HG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/3/2932a215c99f1a5edee7f43a35c4d50c1a505777.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JFG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" /> is a straight line segment. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/6/f1643cb7a181b7f8f8bdef6900cf0732486bc8d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 45 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 35 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 55 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 60 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/3/2932a215c99f1a5edee7f43a35c4d50c1a505777.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$JFG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" /> is a straight line segment, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45bc8004e18293894e61c4d13c860d28ac09b881.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\angle HFG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1ce7adc72c3c082ffa732cbfed889f130fb6b021.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\angle HFJ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> must sum up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/9/1b9e1fa7d59914ce50e0c38d1c6b8df27310a3a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\angle HFG = 180^{\\circ} - 110^{\\circ} = 70^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"242\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/8/bf8c33ab4627404fc14c8faef97a3ac36d215842.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HF = HJ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" /> in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">triangle</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b9ed944bb2784ad0eae0163a3c7e07b8cb7af7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\angle HFG = m \\angle HGF = 70^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"224\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Interior_angle\" title=\"Interior angle\">interior angles</a> of a triangle is always <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/3/e831183c5a54438d34774e5fca541c2a97b5928a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ} + 70^{\\circ} + 70^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"175\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/2/5229b52f4f9454149d342a64c4d54ced9cda74d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ} + 140^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"136\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1dd87a458da112c5dceeedae2dafbe55756599b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 180 - 140 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"201\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat\">2012 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 